Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:01:19.19,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,54)\fad(200,0)\fnRoundHog SemiBold\fs34\c&H00DFB32B}Shengkun Ye (Monid)
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:01:19.19,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,118)\fad(200,0)}“Open sourcing made
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:01:19.19,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,190)\fad(200,0)}suppliers send their own
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:01:19.19,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,262)\fad(200,0)}PRs”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:02.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Yeah, open source for us
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.14,0:00:03.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,really help us with the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.10,0:00:05.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,PMF. We started as the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.86,0:00:08.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,really closed source and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.14,0:00:09.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,but if you think of us
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:10.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,as the two-sided market
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.74,0:00:11.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,we kind of open router
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.82,0:00:13.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,one side that people use
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.06,0:00:14.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,us to connect to all the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.18,0:00:15.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,tools. The other side is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:17.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,all the tool providers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.22,0:00:20.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,Like we started as the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.05,0:00:21.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,closed project for our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.55,0:00:22.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,demand side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.35,0:00:22.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,There are a lot of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.81,0:00:23.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,people use us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.77,0:00:24.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,But what we are not sure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.89,0:00:27.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,is that like how much
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.41,0:00:29.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,leverage we have on our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.73,0:00:30.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,suppliers side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.67,0:00:31.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,Like if you want to let
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.97,0:00:32.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,them to do something for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.83,0:00:33.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,us, like for example
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.73,0:00:34.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,we want them to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.51,0:00:35.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,self-onboarding
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.21,0:00:36.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,themselves to us or let
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.75,0:00:38.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,them to do more stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.31,0:00:39.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,for the integration into
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.35,0:00:40.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,our system
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.39,0:00:41.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,are they willing to do
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.41,0:00:42.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,this? I was not sure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.97,0:00:44.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,since at that time we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.65,0:00:45.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,did all the manual
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.79,0:00:46.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,integration for all the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.83,0:00:47.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,providers and get them
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.69,0:00:48.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.43,0:00:49.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,We did all the manual
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.69,0:00:51.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,work. But after the open
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:53.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,source Monid
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.53,0:00:55.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,we received a lot of PRs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.37,0:00:56.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,from all the different
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.77,0:00:57.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,types of the providers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.93,0:00:58.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,They came to us and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.75,0:00:59.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,said, "Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.19,0:01:00.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,I really want to be
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.59,0:01:01.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,listed on Monid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.79,0:01:03.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,I already submitted my
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.53,0:01:04.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,PR. Can you please
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.93,0:01:06.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,review it?" and then get
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.47,0:01:07.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,it to the hosted version
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.61,0:01:09.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,as well please we've got
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.29,0:01:10.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,so many requests like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.53,0:01:11.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,that and that was the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.63,0:01:12.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,point I realized that
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.85,0:01:13.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,okay I already have a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.85,0:01:14.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,really strong demand
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.75,0:01:16.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,side and suppliers also
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.87,0:01:18.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,love us really well as
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.19,0:01:19.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,well
